# Cargo build directory — local-only, regenerated on every build.
target/

# Editor temporaries.
**/*.rs.bk

# Cargo lock is NOT committed for this crate. It is a library consumed by path
# from each governance guest, and a guest resolves the whole dependency set —
# this crate's included — into its own committed lock. A lock here would be a
# second, unused resolution of the same dependencies, and the copy is what goes
# stale.
Cargo.lock
